        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CSQ-8x8-DB 8\" x 8\" Square Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 8\" x 8\" square door pulls are great for  entry doors, glass doors,  commercial doors, storefront doors, almost any door. They are sold as a back to back pair, 1 pull for each side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CSQ-8x8_size.jpg?v=1704442273\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions CSQ-8x8 Square Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nImpeccably crafted from high grade 1/2\" thick non rusting aluminum, powder coated in Duro Bronze (Dark Bronze) finish\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions CSQ-8x8 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Material: Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Duro Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting (1 pull for each side of a door).</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/first-impressions-door-pulls\">First Impressions Door Pulls</a>\r\n</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>\r\n</p>",
